      </p>

      <p id="highlighted-paragraph">
        What we offer: Our collection includes luxury handbags, versatile totes,
        stylish crossbody bags, durable backpacks, and chic clutches. Each piece
        is crafted with premium materials and attention to detail, making
        Slay-Bags the go-to destination for fashion-forward individuals.
      </p>

      <p class="text-paragraph">
        Bags are more than accessories — they are an extension of personality
        and lifestyle. A well-chosen bag enhances confidence, complements
        outfits, and provides practical functionality. At Slay-Bags, we
        understand this importance and design our products to balance fashion
        with utility.
      </p>

      <p class="text-paragraph">
        Customers choose us because of our transparent pricing, reliable
        delivery, and responsive support. With intuitive navigation and secure
        checkout, shopping for your perfect bag becomes a seamless experience.
        Every purchase reflects our commitment to style, sustainability, and
        customer satisfaction.
      </p>

      <p id="final-paragraph">
        In short, Slay-Bags is where elegance meets practicality. Our bags are
        not just carriers of essentials — they are symbols of identity,
        confidence, and purpose.
      </p>

      <a href="index.html" class="back-link">← Back to Home</a>
